# Copy this file to .env and paste in YOUR OWN keys.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# .env is gitignored and must stay that way. A key in a commit is a key on the
# internet — treat one that leaks as already spent, and revoke it in AI Studio.

# --- Gemini: the only key you need to start (session 1) -----------------------
# Create at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey — free, no card required.
# The SDK reads GEMINI_API_KEY automatically; you never pass it in code.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# ⚠️ FREE TIER PROMPTS ARE USED TO TRAIN GOOGLE'S MODELS.
# Google's pricing page lists "content used to improve our products" as Yes for
# the free tier, No for paid. So: never paste real customer data, real names,
# real card numbers or anything from your employer into a free-tier notebook.
# Every ticket in data/tickets.yml is invented for exactly this reason.

# --- What the free key does and doesn't unlock --------------------------------
# Free is enough for everything you are asked to build in this course: text,
# multimodal input (sending images/audio/PDFs), structured JSON output,
# streaming, and embeddings.
#
# Two capabilities need a BILLING-ENABLED key, and they appear only as
# instructor demos, marked 💳 in the notebooks:
#   · Google Search grounding   (S01 §7.4 — answering from the live web)
#   · Image generation          (S01 §7.5 — gemini-3.1-flash-image)
# Those cells are written to catch the error and explain it rather than crash,
# and every notebook ships with its outputs committed — so nothing in this
# course requires you to enable billing. If you do enable it, they just run.

# --- Model choice (optional) --------------------------------------------------
# Every session's config.py falls back to these defaults, so you can leave them
# blank. Set one here to change it everywhere at once — useful when a model is
# retired, or to try a stronger one. S01 §9.6 has a cell that lists whatever
# model IDs your key can actually see today, which is the real source of truth.
#   SHOPWISE_MODEL=gemini-3.1-flash-lite    # course default: cheapest, fast
#   SHOPWISE_MODEL_STRONG=gemini-3.6-flash  # when quality matters more
#   SHOPWISE_MODEL_PRO=gemini-2.5-pro       # the free tier's best reasoning model
#   SHOPWISE_MODEL_IMAGE=gemini-3.1-flash-image  # image generation (billed only)

# --- LangSmith: from session 4 -----------------------------------------------
# Your own free account at https://smith.langchain.com — your traces stay in
# your workspace, nobody else's.
LANGSMITH_TRACING=true
LANGSMITH_API_KEY=
LANGSMITH_PROJECT=shopwise

# --- Qdrant: session 8 runs locally, no signup and no keys ------------------
# Only fill these in at session 15, if you move to Qdrant Cloud.
QDRANT_URL=
QDRANT_API_KEY=
